Context: Splits non-negative integer cents into n>0 positive integer parts using floor division + remainder distribution so parts differ by at most 1 and sum exactly to total; explicit guards prevent division-by-zero, negative parts, and non-integer inputs.
Confidence: 0.9
Open: Behavior under concurrent mutation of inputs (irrelevant for ints) or extremely large n (memory exhaustion) not tested.

